<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.43757.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.43757.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.43757, versus 1.43893 yesterday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.23614   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	7.55731   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	163.236   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.86025   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.81626   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    15.7486   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     46.1208   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	1.96731   (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     8.56073   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah 3375.41   (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	n/a	 (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2198.79   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.430696   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.50928   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  9.30755   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.38370   (4.25788)</p>
<p> S.A. Rand	   6.70986   (0.80200)</p>
<p> Spanish Peseta    188.235   (69.0742)</p>
<p> Swedish Kronor    9.85886   (5.31489)</p>
<p> Swiss Franc	 1.91844   (3.19548)</p>
<p> U.A.E. Dirham     5.27732   (4.76057)</p>
<p>S.A. Rand July 2, Australian Dlr Aug 1, Canadian Dlr July 2, Indonesian Rupiah July 19, Iranian Rial July 22, Saudi Riyal Aug 9, all 1974. Swiss Franc Sept 16, 1975.</p>
